shape: sequence_diagram

title: Save a new or existing item {
  near: top-center
  shape: text
  style.font-size: 20
}

person: Person
client: Web or Android
api: Function App
cosmos: Cosmos

person -> client: Add or edit an item
client -> client: Check the fields
client -> api: POST /items when new, or PUT with If-Match
api -> api: Check the token and the fields again
api -> api: Set id, userId, and schemaVersion
api -> cosmos: Create the document, or replace it if the etag matches
cosmos -> api: Stored item and new etag
api -> client: 201 or 200, with id and etag
client -> client: Recompute Today, week, and order
